@startuml
title UC-04: Guest cart to COD checkout
start
:Open cart;
if (Member signed in?) then (no)
  :Sign in and retain Guest cart;
  :Merge valid Guest lines;
endif
:Review cart and owned address;
:Submit COD checkout with idempotency key;
:Recalculate USD totals, voucher, Seller status and stock;
if (Valid and stock available?) then (yes)
  :Begin PostgreSQL transaction;
  :Decrement stock and create customer/Seller orders;
  :Snapshot lines and append audit;
  if (Commit succeeds?) then (yes)
    :Show Pending Payment portions;
  else (no)
    :Rollback and show error;
  endif
else (no)
  :Show error without writes;
endif
stop
@enduml
